"Draganfly Makes Strategic Investment in Ukraine Defence Technology Company Solution - Draganfly (https://draganfly.com/press-release/draganfly-makes-strategic-investment-in-ukraine-defence-technology-company-solution/)\nciteturn39search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: today; Content type: text/plain; \nDraganfly Makes Strategic Investment in Ukraine Defence Technology Company Solution - Draganfly PRESS RELEASE Draganfly Makes Strategic Investment in Ukraine Defence Technology Company Solution Investment is intended to support accelerated deployment of advanced onboard autonomy technology for unmanned systems across global markets. Tampa, Florida, Oct. 13, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Draganfly Inc. (NASDAQ: DPRO; CSE: DPRO; FSE: 3U8) (“Draganfly” or the “Company”), a developer of drone solutions and systems, today announced that it has made a strategic investment in Ukraine defence technology company DoD Solution. DoD Solution is an Estonian-Ukrainian defence technology company, developer of advanced onboard autonomy for unmanned systems. Its AURA AI platform combines the AURA SBC onboard computer with AURA OS, an advanced software stack designed to support navigation, perception, target recognition and tracking, and terminal guidance when GPS or communications are degraded or unavailable. The platform is uniquely designed for use across multiple unmanned systems, including FPV drones, interceptors and fixed-wing aircraft. The investment reflects Draganfly’s focus on advanced technologies proven in combat that can expand the capabilities of unmanned systems operating in demanding environments. As part of this transaction,... Solution, sharing our collective experience and capabilities will help accelerate important advancement into the hands of users at a speed and scale designed to provide them with the advantages needed to be successful,” said Cameron Chell, Chief Executive Officer of Draganfly Inc. About DoD Solution DoD Solution is an Estonian-Ukrainian defence technology company developing onboard computers and autonomy systems for unmanned platforms. Its AURA AI platform combines software and onboard computing to support autonomous capabilities in contested environments. For more information, visit dodsolution.com. About Draganfly Draganfly Inc. (NASDAQ: DPRO; CSE: DPRO; FSE: 3U8) is a Canadian-headquartered developer of advanced drone solutions, unmanned systems and software serving customers across North America and globally. With more than 27 years of experience in unmanned systems, Draganfly develops and delivers technologies spanning aerial platforms, autonomy, sensing, payload integration and mission-specific solutions for defense, public safety, civil, industrial, agriculture, security, mapping and surveying applications. The Company combines engineering, manufacturing, software and systems-integration capabilities to support customers operating in complex and mission-critical environments. Draganfly is driven by a mission to provide innovative, reliable solutions that save time, money and lives. For more information, visit www.draganfly.com. For investor details, visit: NASDAQ (DPRO) CSE (DPRO) FSE (3U8A) Media Contact Erika Racicot Email: [email protected]Company Contact Cameron Chell Chief Executive Officer (306) 955-9907 Email: [email protected] Forward-Looking Statements This release contains certain “forward looking statements” and certain “forward-looking information” as defined under applicable securities laws. Forward-looking statements and information can generally be identified by the use of forward-looking terminology such as “may”, “will”, “expect”, “intend”, “estimate”, “anticipate”, “believe”, “continue”, “plan” or similar terminology. Forward-looking statements and information are based on forecasts of future results, estimates of amounts not yet determinable and assumptions that, while believed...--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nhttps://www.sec.gov/Archiv